Package: stellar-archivist-rs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: Rust toolset for working with stellar-core history archives
 This package provides the Rust implementation of stellar-archivist, a toolset
 for scanning, mirroring, and repairing stellar-core history archives. The
 binary is installed as /usr/bin/stellar-archivist-rs so it can coexist with the
 Go stellar-archivist package.
